  GDAL (inside rasterio's wheels): MIT/X. Source: https://github.com/OSGeo/gdal
  PROJ (inside the rasterio and pyproj wheels): MIT. Source: https://github.com/OSGeo/PROJ
  pyproj: MIT. Source: https://github.com/pyproj4/pyproj
  GEOS (inside rasterio's wheels): GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1, a separate shared
